{"id":"2a57555074c2fb5c","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient.md","title":"不交和PER的商集分解","display":"thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient — 不交和PER的商集分解","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient","aliases":["72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient"],"display":"thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient — 不交和PER的商集分解","depends_on":["[[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X disjoint sums and PER membership print739–750/PDF751–762; local quotient theorem","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient — 不交和PER的商集分解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a4db441ff403134f\" href=\"?note=a4db441ff403134f\" title=\"72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per\">72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X disjoint sums and PER membership print739–750/PDF751–762; local quotient theorem"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\beta,\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}\">\\(\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\beta,\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4db441ff403134f\" href=\"?note=a4db441ff403134f\" title=\"72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per\">72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per</a> 的全部结构条件及输出PER资格。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:=\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\">\\(R:=\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta\\)</span>；注入项均自求值、单射且两像不交。类与商集取既有 PER 接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_+\">\\(q_+\\)</span> 在下式构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nq_+:={}&amp;\\{\\langle[\\mathsf{inl}(a)]_R,\\langle0,[a]_\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle[\\mathsf{inr}(b)]_R,\\langle1,[b]_\\beta\\rangle\\rangle:b\\in|\\beta|\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nq_+:={}&amp;\\{\\langle[\\mathsf{inl}(a)]_R,\\langle0,[a]_\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle[\\mathsf{inr}(b)]_R,\\langle1,[b]_\\beta\\rangle\\rangle:b\\in|\\beta|\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_+:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\n(\\{0\\}\\times(|\\alpha|/\\alpha))\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(|\\beta|/\\beta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_+:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\n(\\{0\\}\\times(|\\alpha|/\\alpha))\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(|\\beta|/\\beta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个 R 支撑项求值为恰一个左值或右值，与该值在同一商类。两个规范左值相关恰当且仅当分量 α 相关，右值同理；不同标签不会相关，因为确定求值与注入像不交。因而图在商类上单值且单射，每个目标标签类有规范注入见证，故满射。任一分量为空也成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per","status":"resolved","id":"a4db441ff403134f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per","status":"resolved","id":"a4db441ff403134f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\beta,\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}$ 采用 [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] 的全部结构条件及输出PER资格。$R:=\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta$；注入项均自求值、单射且两像不交。类与商集取既有 PER 接口；$q_+$ 在下式构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\beta,\\mathsf{inl},\\mathsf{inr}","display":false},{"tex":"R:=\\alpha\\oplus_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"q_+","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nq_+:={}&\\{\\langle[\\mathsf{inl}(a)]_R,\\langle0,[a]_\\alpha\\rangle\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\langle[\\mathsf{inr}(b)]_R,\\langle1,[b]_\\beta\\rangle\\rangle:b\\in|\\beta|\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"q_+:|R|/R\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\n(\\{0\\}\\times(|\\alpha|/\\alpha))\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(|\\beta|/\\beta)).","display":true}],"bytes":1776,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[